.notice { padding: 9px 11px; background: color-mix(in srgb, CanvasText 8%, Canvas); border-radius: 6px; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;body&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Faster connections and file navigation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expand OpenSSH aliases to direct addresses, revisit SFTP paths with mouse buttons, and move remote file panels within a tab.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use an alias as a direct address&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Choose Use address to expand the effective hostname, user, port, and identity from OpenSSH configuration into the connection form.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigate recent SFTP paths&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Use the mouse Back and Forward buttons over a file panel. Right-click a file or folder to copy its full path.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rearrange remote panels&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Drag a remote panel by its grip to move it within the current SFTP tab. Click unused list space to clear the selection.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recover visible terminal panes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Returning to a tab refreshes its visible terminal dimensions and display.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Close active sessions before updating. Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.0.5"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
